                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "coin",
                  "description": "(Required) The coin or token ticker (for example `btc`, `eth`, `hteth`, `sol`, `matic`). Testnet coins are prefixed with `t` (for example `tbtc`)."
